    <li class="lt-chem-45385"><i>The Henderson-Hasselbalch equation: its history and limitations</i> - Henry N. Po and N.M. Senoza, <i>J.Chem. Ed.</i> 78 (11) 2001 (1499-1503)</li>
    <li class="lt-chem-45385">A detailed treatment of log-C vs pH diagrams can be found in the book <i>Acid-base diagrams</i> by Kahlert and Schotz. It is available online in some college libraries.</li>
